tions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/css","state":"uploaded","size":28060,"digest":"sha256:d70d8ebd41fc23bfd5d59873b1a93ed9554b154546a3e637bd4e042e62d1cf23","download_count":104970,"created_at":"2026-10-16T21:36:27Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T21:36:27Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/obsidian-tasks-group/obsidian-tasks/releases/download/8.6.0/styles.css"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/obsidian-tasks-group/obsidian-tasks/tarball/8.6.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/obsidian-tasks-group/obsidian-tasks/zipball/8.6.0","body":"## What's Changed\r\n\r\n### 🌟 Most Notable\r\n\r\nPlease run the **Reload app without saving** command or **quit and restart Obsidian** after updating the plugin. Thank you.\r\n\r\n- **Update** minimum supported Obsidian version to [1.13.1](https://obsidian.md/changelog/2026-06-09-desktop-v1.13.1/).\r\n- **Add** setting to control [which field the Postpone button edits](https://publish.obsidian.md/tasks/Editing/Postponing#Which+date+field+is+edited%3F).\r\n- **Development**\r\n    - Added [Obsidian Checks](https://publish.obsidian.md/tasks-contributing/Linting/Obsidian+Checks) workflow.\r\n\r\n**Screenshots**\r\n\r\n<img width=\"500\"  alt=\"setting\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3060b661-a39f-47bb-ae3a-96e3c970b075\" />\r\n\r\n**Available options**\r\n\r\n<img width=\"500\"  alt=\"options\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fc723cc7-1409-4ccf-9e27-abb29b3b51ec\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n#### 🌟 Features\r\n\r\n- feat: add setting to configure postpone button date field by @lingow in https://github.com/obsidian-tasks-group/obsidian-tasks/pull/4083\r\n- feat!!: Remove support for Obsidian 1.13.0 and earlier by @claremacrae in https://github.com/obsidian-tasks-group/obsidian-tasks/pull/4084\r\n- feat: Delete unused \"features\" settings value (if value was not edited) by @claremacrae in https://github.com/obsidian-tasks-group/obsidian-tasks/pull/4088\r\n- feat: Delete last unused settings \"generalSettings\" & \"headingOpened\" by @claremacrae in https://github.com/obsidian-tasks-group/obsidian-tasks/pull/4089\r\n- feat!!: Finish removing support for Obsidian 1.13.1 and earlier by @claremacrae in https://github.com/obsidian-tasks-group/obsidian-tasks/pull/4095\r\n\r\n#### 🛠️ Behind the scenes\r\n\r\nOther changes:\r\n\r\n- chore: Invoke strict obsidian-workflow checks on commits and PRs by @claremacrae in https://github.com/obsidian-tasks-group/obsidian-tasks/pull/4091\r\n- refactor: Minor improvements to the new postpone settings by @claremacrae in https://github.com/obsidian-tasks-group/obsidian-tasks/pull/4093\r\n- test: Sample files & tests to see underlying cause of #4081 by @claremacrae in https://github.com/obsidian-tasks-group/obsidian-tasks/pull/4082\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n\r\n* @lingow made their first contribution in https://github.com/obsidian-tasks-group/obsidian-tasks/pull/4083\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog** (including changes too small to note above, and that do not affect the behaviour of the plugin itself):\r\n- <https://github.com/obsidian-tasks-group/obsidian-tasks/compare/8.5.0...8.6.0>\r\n\r\n**🙏 Support Tasks development**\r\n- <https://github.com/sponsors/claremacrae>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/obsidian-tasks-group/obsidian-tasks/releases/415399720/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":3,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":2}